#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 20 description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FORMATTIME_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Set the format of time in the game. The 12-hour format is used in the United"
" States of America, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, New Zealand and "
"Latin American countries. The 24-hour format is predominantly used in the "
"rest of the world."
msgstr ""
