#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKENABLED_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 22 description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKENABLED_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Lock at which frame rate the game is rendered. Useful for displays that "
"don't support Variable Refresh Rate or for a more consistent performance."
msgstr ""
"Nastavte pevnou snímkovou frekvenci. Hodí se pro monitory bez proměnné "
"obnovovací frekvence a může zajistit plynulejší obraz."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKENABLED_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 22 name"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKENABLED_NAME"
msgid "Frame rate lock"
msgstr "Limit snímkové frekvence"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKTARGET_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 23 description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_FPSLOCKTARGET_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The number of frames the game will target when the frame rate lock is "
"enabled. Generally, you would want to lock the framerate at the same number "
"as the refresh rate of your display."
msgstr ""
"Cílová snímková frekvence při zapnutém omezení. Obvykle je vhodné nastavit "
"stejnou hodnotu, jakou má obnovovací frekvence monitoru."

