#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NOISEVISIBILITYWIND_NAME"
msgid "Noise, visibility, wind"
msgstr "Hluk, viditelnost, vítr"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAFRAMEGENERATION_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 122 description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAFRAMEGENERATION_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Use neural networks to improve how smooth the game appears. The feature increases the frame rate by generating additional frames between rendered frames. We recommend to enable it along with NVIDIA Reflex so that Frame Generation doesn't make input lag noticeable.\n"
"\n"
"Officially, the feature is only supported starting with GeForce RTX 40-Series."
msgstr ""
"Pomocí neuronových sítí zvyšuje plynulost obrazu. Funkce zvyšuje snímkovou frekvenci generováním dalších snímků mezi vykreslenými snímky. Doporučujeme ji zapnout společně s NVIDIA Reflex, aby zpoždění odezvy ovládání způsobené generováním snímků nebylo znatelné.\n"
"\n"
"Oficiálně je tato funkce podporována od řady GeForce RTX 40-Series."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAFRAMEGENERATION_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 122 name"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAFRAMEGENERATION_NAME"
msgid "NVIDIA Frame Generation"
msgstr "NVIDIA Frame Generation"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAREFLEX_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 123 description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAREFLEX_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Reduce input lag to make controls more responsive. The feature synchronizes "
"the CPU and GPU to ensure your actions are quickly reflected on your "
"display, especially if it supports G-Sync. We recommend to enable this "
"feature. With the Boost option, you'll receive an additional improvement at "
"the potential cost of saving less energy."
msgstr ""
"Snižuje zpoždění odezvy ovládání. Funkce synchronizuje CPU a GPU, aby se "
"vaše akce rychle projevily na displeji, zejména pokud podporuje G-Sync. "
"Doporučujeme ji zapnout. Režim Boost dále zlepší odezvu, ale může zvýšit "
"spotřebu energie."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAREFLEX_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "setting 123 name"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,KEY_METAGAME_SETTINGS_NVIDIAREFLEX_NAME"
msgid "NVIDIA Reflex"
msgstr "NVIDIA Reflex"

